{"id":"riso","lemma":"riso","pos":"noun","rank":2374,"glosses":["laughter, laugh"],"ipa":"/ˈʁi.zu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1b/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-riso.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-riso.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"risos"},"examples":[{"text":"O riso é contagioso.","en":"Laughter is contagious.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"contagious"}]},{"text":"Não gosto de ser motivo de riso.","en":"I don't want to be laughed at.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"taste"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"motive"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"O riso ajuda a aliviar a dor.","en":"Laughter helps ease the pain.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"help, assistance, aid"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to relieve"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"pain"}]},{"text":"O riso das crianças podia ser ouvido à distância.","en":"Children's laughter could be heard in the distance.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,null,{"g":"child","l":"criança"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"hearing"},{"g":"forms adverbs meaning…"},{"g":"distance"}]},{"text":"O presidente não pôde conter o riso.","en":"The president laughed in spite of himself.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"president"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to contain"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}